.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-pin-set-admin 1  "oct-pin-set-admin " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-pin\-set\-admin \- Set Admin PIN
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct pin set\-admin\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\-old\fR] [\fB\-Q\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\-new\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Set Admin PIN
.PP
Set a new Admin PIN by providing the current Admin PIN.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\-old\fR \fI<Admin PIN file old>\fR
Optionally, get old Admin PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-Q\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\-new\fR \fI<Admin PIN file new>\fR
Optionally, get new Admin PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
